{"asks":[{"quote":"If you disagree, say so and I'll add it under Appearance.","question":"Should the activity strip have an Appearance preference to hide it for single-subagent turns?","kind":"decision","options":["Keep no preference","Add Appearance toggle"]},{"quote":"Do you want Strata to normalize these, for example always showing \"Explore: search for tests\" style labels, or should it show what the provider sent?","question":"Should Strata normalize subagent labels or display provider-supplied labels?","kind":"decision","options":["Normalize labels","Show provider labels"]},{"quote":"Tell me which you'd rather see and I'll do that one.","question":"After completion, should activity stay collapsed under the message or move into the Trace drawer?","kind":"decision","options":["Keep under message","Move to Trace drawer"]},{"quote":"Is eight the right number, or would you rather it show everything and scroll?","question":"Should the strip show eight rows or all rows with scrolling?","kind":"decision","options":["Eight visible rows","Show all and scroll"]},{"quote":"Is that enough, or do you want the error inline?","question":"Should subagent errors remain only in Trace or also appear inline in the activity strip?","kind":"decision","options":["Trace only","Show inline error"]},{"quote":"I can add it back if it's useful to you.","question":"Should per-subagent token usage be added to each activity row?","kind":"decision","options":["Keep usage totals only","Add per-row usage"]},{"quote":"Let me know if you'd rather I hold this until the link-opening change lands, since both touch the Conversation panel and there's a small merge risk in the message component.","question":"Should this work wait until the link-opening change lands?","kind":"decision","options":["Proceed now","Hold until link-opening change"]}]}
